From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vrchat-dfr-linux contributors
 <vrchat-dfr-linux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:40:23 +0900
Subject: [dxvk] Hook gaze-driven VRS into rendering

Attach the gaze shading-rate image to eligible passes, switch the dynamic shading-rate combiner per draw, create pipelines with dynamic shading-rate state when DXVK_GAZE_VRS=1, and query the device features the attachment needs.
---
